      "description": "The DVD PLAYER's own firmware, not a boot rom - a machine will not start from one. It is here because the choice is offered for completeness; if the machine does not boot, this is why. This project asks for DVD player Japan v2.00, which is the dump usually called ps2-dvd-200j.bin. Another dump of the same release will do; a different release is a different machine, and the Boot ROM setting is where to say so.",
